      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so im T2 diabetic and i started taking this new berry extract supplement for energy a couple days ago and now im like seriously thirsty all the time and feel like i gotta pee every 20 mins... its kinda annoying lol. do u think the supplement is just making me dehydrated or something? maybe i just need to drink more water?",
